# ── Deployment configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and edit. `.env` is gitignored.
# On CI (GitHub Actions) set these as repository variables instead.

# Absolute origin of the deployed site — drives canonical URLs,
# sitemap, RSS links, and Open Graph tags.
SITE_URL=https://lamdev.github.io

# '/' for a user site (username.github.io) or a custom domain;
# '/repo-name' when deploying to GitHub project pages.
BASE_PATH=/

# ── Content configuration lives in code, not env ─────────────────────
# Site identity (name, domain, prompt, OS version, tagline, description):
#   src/data/site.ts        ← single source of truth, edit once
# Social links:              src/data/nav.ts   (SOCIALS)
# Categories & tag mapping:  src/data/topics.ts
# Personal info / bio:       src/pages/about/index.astro (NOW, ID_ROWS, STACK)
# Posts:                     src/content/posts/*.md
